    hidden underneath.\r\n\r\n    If the 2 icons matches, they\u2019ll stay open.
    \r\n    If the 2 card does not match, they close.\r\n\r\n\r\nStep 3: Open all
    the Cards. Keep matching pairs until all the Cards are revealed within a Time
    Limit!"
